  "title": "websocket: Support port dissector table for Decode As and Heuristics",
  "description": "Websocket has a port dissector table, which isn't used by the main\ncodebase but can be by third party plugins.\n\nThe server port, used for lookups in the table, is set to the HTTP\nserver port when the Websocket conversation is set up by HTTP Upgrade.\nWhen not set up by HTTP upgrade, use the matched port if Decode As\nset up the Websocket conversation, and look for a dissector in the\ntable, trying the lower numbered port first, if set up by the\nWebsocket heuristic dissector.",
